        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The time indexed part of pattern. 
This pattern re-uses part of and time-indexed situation patterns. It is extracted from DOLCE-UltraLite by partial clone of elements.</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Timeindexedpartof Pattern</dcterms:title>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label moved to skos:prefLabel x1; label added x9; term declared x3;
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Timeindexedpartof Pattern&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
Each change is listed under &quot;curated&quot; in the pattern&apos;s metadata.json in OntoBoard&apos;s pattern library.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The time indexed part of pattern. 
This pattern re-uses part of and time-indexed situation patterns. It is extracted from DOLCE-UltraLite by partial clone of elements.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:versionInfo rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">0.1: Created by Aldo Gangemi
0.2: Revised as a specialization of timeindexedsituation.owl</owl:versionInfo>
        <owl:versionInfo rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.1 added rdfs:isDefinedBy for all named entities</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


